{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:18d05fd7bf3921dd","name":"Fetwin Porlo","source":{"id":"source:reference-18d05fd7bf3921dd","title":"Fetwin Porlo","revision":19660,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:22:23Z","sha256":"35602d2f883e13752b716093ded30211e70ef4e68f530b7fa9fd021e64262e33","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19660","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Fetwin%20Porlo&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-18d05fd7bf3921dd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of Point Nadir's most influential information brokers is Fetwin Porlo, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toydarian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toydarian","referenceId":"reference:3470d92d0a6cef2e"}," who boasts of humble beginnings on his home planet. He started his life as a librarian, shuffling data and cataloguing documents for scholars at a preeminent university. In the course of his duties, he stumbled upon information that incriminated university officers in a variety of crimes. Given his low pay and nearly invisible status at the university, Porlo did not think twice about using the information to make a profit for himself.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though his attempts at blackmail were initially successful, Porlo cultivated a large number of enemies. They grew tired of his constant chiseling, eventually finding it more convenient to neutralize him rather than meet his demands. Within hours Porlo was on the run, fleeing for his life and eventually coming to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point Nadir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point_Nadir","referenceId":"reference:480bbe618709d93f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Porlo is a portly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toydarian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toydarian","referenceId":"reference:3470d92d0a6cef2e"}," with blue-green skin and bulbous green eyes. He flutters about nervously, never staying in one spot for long. Fetwin's wardrobe consists mostly of baggy, single-piece lounge suits that he rarely finds time to launder. He speaks in a quick, albeit distracted, manner, and he makes little sense to people who don't know him well.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Fetwin Porlo Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toydarian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toydarian","referenceId":"reference:3470d92d0a6cef2e"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 3; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +11\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Bothese, Huttese, Ryl, Toydarian\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 21 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 19), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.